config MISC_ADAU1442
	tristate "Analog Devices ADAU1442 SigmaDSP audio processor"
	depends on I2C
	select REGMAP_I2C
	help
	  Driver for the Analog Devices ADAU1442 SigmaDSP audio processor.

	  Controls audio routing via I2C and exposes /dev/adau1442 for
	  userspace parameter control using safeload.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called adau1442.
